algorithms.pseudocode:
Algorithm: ComputeSecondShadow(S, n)
Input: Finite set S ⊆ ℕⁿ, dimension n
Output: Sh₂(S)

shadow ← ∅
for each α ∈ S:
    for i ← 1 to n:
        for j ← 1 to n:
            if α[i] ≥ 1 and (α - eᵢ)[j] ≥ 1:
                β ← α - eᵢ - eⱼ
                shadow ← shadow ∪ {β}
return shadow

Complexity: O(|S| · n²) time, O(|Sh₂(S)|) space
